# A loop its player keeps going by choice must end with that player choosing otherwise (CR 732.2a, 732.3). The Worldgorger
# Dragon loop with Bot2's Entombed Ornithopter in a graveyard too, as in
# worldgorger-dragon-loop-ends-when-animate-dead-chooses-another-creature-card - but the script never makes Animate Dead's
# choice, and Bot1's seat, left to itself, takes the first creature card offered, the Dragon, every time round, as a seat
# that never stops a loop would. Each time Animate Dead enters it chooses what it enchants (CR 303.4f): a real choice, so
# the loop is no draw (CR 104.4b). Choosing the Dragon again and again, Bot1 has in effect chosen how many times to go round
# (CR 732.2a); once the loop has come round many times, the active player, who is the one choosing in it, must make a
# different choice so that it does not continue (CR 732.3), and the next time Animate Dead chooses, the Dragon - the answer
# Bot1 gave there before - is not among its choices: it enchants the Ornithopter, which it returns under Bot1's control
# (CR 110.2), and the loop is over. The Dragon stays in Bot1's graveyard; the Swamps are untapped, as the loop returned them.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Animate Dead
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Worldgorger Dragon
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot2.Search(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Worldgorger Dragon)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Stack.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Animate Dead; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Animate Dead.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Worldgorger Dragon; Entomb
Bot2.Graveyard = Entomb
